[{"title":"孟子 周公之过","author":"陈普","text":"过血乖离惨极刑，人情天理岂其真。\n天心处置非无意，故把瑕疵累圣人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7459,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 夜气","author":"陈普","text":"气无所帅任崩奔，东骛西驰利欲昏。\n人事才停机械息，天心无间本真存。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7460,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 孟子见梁惠王","author":"陈普","text":"道气凄凉七百年，招贤一举独非天。\n当场礼义难分别，回首空山重惘然。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7461,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 孟子去齐","author":"陈普","text":"女乐之行恨未忘，时人又为去齐伤。\n圣贤出处常如此，道运终天孰主张。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7462,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 孟子好辩","author":"陈普","text":"禽兽纵横鬼魅多，人间岐路总差讹。\n当时缄口终无语，天理民彝竟若何。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7463,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 尚友","author":"陈普","text":"贤圣虽亡心不死，诗书所在即其人。\n大人取友无今古，天地中间一性真。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7464,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 性善","author":"陈普","text":"异论纵横害已深，一言性善发天心。\n民彝物则依然定，多少纲常起兽禽。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7465,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 放太甲","author":"陈普","text":"未道鸣条作网罗，近来亳邑转偏颇。\n嗣君可到先王墓，为问南巢事若何。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7466,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 易地皆然","author":"陈普","text":"今古无过只一中，随时适变不相通。\n圣贤心术无偏倚，事业虽殊道则同。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7467,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 枉尺直寻","author":"陈普","text":"计利无非患得心，谁能枉己直于人。\n既甘隐忍无羞恶，气馁如何更复伸。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7468,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 知言","author":"陈普","text":"识见超然地位高，人言情伪察秋毫。\n一些疾病生心腹，明鉴当台不可逃。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7469,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 终身之忧","author":"陈普","text":"冠屦昂昂数尺躯，圣贤无我意何殊。\n伊人德业光天地，在我宁甘食粟夫。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7470,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 终身慕父母","author":"陈普","text":"外物安能乱本真，终天眷慕受恩深。\n大人所在元无坏，不失初来赤子心。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7471,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 舍生取义","author":"陈普","text":"义在甘心自杀身，人情天理此为真。\n谁能出段乾坤里，长作偷生负罪人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7472,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 诡遇获禽","author":"陈普","text":"诡遇背驰先自失，丘陵之获亦何为。\n彼哉舍己徇于物，所得安能直所遗。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7473,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 养小失小","author":"陈普","text":"为尧为舜配三才，功用都从此处来。\n颠倒反为饥渴想，迷轻失重亦堪哀。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7474,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 养心寡欲","author":"陈普","text":"心体自然安用养，多因迷欲易成昏。\n但能寡欲无私累，本体清明理自存。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7475,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 养气","author":"陈普","text":"养气元来甚可为，只须身与理相随。\n待今自反俱无歉，直是工夫效验时。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7476,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 养志","author":"陈普","text":"世俗养亲惟口体，谁能养志若曾参。\n至诚顺适无违昲，为是心其父母心。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7477,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 思诚","author":"陈普","text":"气形与理一齐生，诚妄相须两并行。\n须是本心无走失，所存熟后自能诚。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7478,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 禹汤文武周公","author":"陈普","text":"千圣相承惟道一，忧勤惕厉意尤深。\n至诚之理元无息，有息良非天地心。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7479,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 要汤","author":"陈普","text":"畎亩一身尧舜乐，幡然尧舜在君民。\n别无鼎俎要汤具，为有华勋道在身。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7480,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 贵贵尊贤","author":"陈普","text":"贵贵如天礼极隆，无人更识下贤风。\n岂知坤位居乾上，天地之交泰道通。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7481,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 闻知","author":"陈普","text":"神知不在见知闻，气化流行一本存。\n轲后谁言无复有，遗歌依旧起龙门。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7482,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 食色性也","author":"陈普","text":"食色虽然人固有，原于形气所由根。\n苟徒即此名为性，太极之真已弗存。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7483,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 格非","author":"陈普","text":"纠缪绳愆皆末务，徒劳事事与之争。\n非心格尽常于道，本正源澄万派清。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7484,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 浩然","author":"陈普","text":"至刚至大莫能言，宇宙天人总一般。\n须是意诚心正日，本来体段始堪观。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7485,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 猎较","author":"陈普","text":"道体从宜无害义，不容外物独违时。\n未能槁食并泉饮，咽李哇鹅岂可为。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7486,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 善信美大","author":"陈普","text":"善得于心皆实有，本根植立已无亏。\n美而且大并神圣，熟后工夫出不期。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7487,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 湍水","author":"陈普","text":"湍水萦回随所决，亦须顺道乃从流。\n若非所性元趋下，料可东西决得不。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7488,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 禅继","author":"陈普","text":"处变安常两不同，圣心天地与为公。\n要知授受精微处，不问亲疏共一中。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7489,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 舜大孝","author":"陈普","text":"暮雨梧山泪满襟，皇天珍重意尤深。\n一时瞽瞍烝烝乂，万古人间慈孝心。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7490,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"孟子 践形","author":"陈普","text":"理苟非形何以具，有形有象即其郛。\n非能尽性充乎体，空守人间血肉躯。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7491,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"武夷一曲","author":"陈普","text":"虹桥一断几千龄，亲手文公再造成。\n何事游人尚迷路，乱寻无楫渡船撑。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7492,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"姚国秀十咏 其七 小山","author":"陈普","text":"平生一丘愿，不忘岳连姿。\n若求静寿意，一篑有馀师。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7493,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"姚国秀十咏 其一 东塾","author":"陈普","text":"濂溪义安取，新郑与新丰。\n所以东塾子，拳拳东塾翁。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7494,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"姚国秀十咏 其三 玉女峰","author":"陈普","text":"道心苦难足，造物冷看人。\n铁汉未成就，遗渠妍笑颦。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7495,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"姚国秀十咏 其四 勒马山","author":"陈普","text":"六合横驰骛，道人门不开。\n回头顾明命，鞭辟入身来。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7496,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"姚国秀十咏 其十 梅窗","author":"陈普","text":"年年佩温故，先入一枝来。\n岁寒吾与女，欲别重徘徊。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7497,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"姚国秀十咏 其九 菱塘","author":"陈普","text":"廉隅集谣咏，举世尚和光。\n平生憎老子，蓄雨肥菱塘。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7498,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"姚国秀十咏 其二 溪庄","author":"陈普","text":"畴昔何来此，青山与白鸥。\n絮飞春不去，潮返月频留。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7499,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"爱日 其二","author":"陈普","text":"一寸光阴直万钱，况兼妙质与崇年。\n睡魔懒祟俱驱去，要与窗驹斗着鞭。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7500,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"爱日 其一","author":"陈普","text":"绝妙茅斋对竹林，少年日月直千金。\n殷勤好与此君约，不许空移一寸阴。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7501,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"读史 其一","author":"陈普","text":"王莽当年似姬旦，炀皇前日肖曾参。\n担囊揭箧何须逐，盗贼谁无仁义心。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7502,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"读史 其八","author":"陈普","text":"晏婴白日为谗贼，吾道何用尤臧仓。\n啜粥倚庐深墨面，天地不遣君齐梁。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7503,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"读史 其七","author":"陈普","text":"不是二颜张许辈，故将躯命委沙尘。\n天生熊掌真滋味，自美自甘难告人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7504,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"读史 其六","author":"陈普","text":"祝网三驱百圣同，仲尼无语孟牵弓。\n雷霆日月谁能避，肯向门前著大虫。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7505,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"读史 其五","author":"陈普","text":"天踰铁勒偏无夜，地到扶桑更有人。\n民首自黔心自白，诗书万古不忧秦。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7506,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"读史 其四","author":"陈普","text":"马六尾五四代士，葱寸肉方千世心。\n浮云转眼百千态，惟有性情无古今。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7507,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"读史 其三","author":"陈普","text":"董卓犹知用荀爽，蔡京也解召杨时。\n善人寿命如松柏，自有神明好护持。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7508,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"读史 其二","author":"陈普","text":"王敦自叹非盛德，国忠自言无令名。\n狐死不知正丘首，人伦都尽虎狼行。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7509,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"高宗帖","author":"陈普","text":"寝苫枕干子，有暇绾秋蛇。\n仁人不忍见，俗子持相誇。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7510,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"偶占","author":"陈普","text":"水边侧耳翠萄叶，陂下销魂金步摇。\n何以浔阳北窗下，白云伴宿听翛翛。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7511,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"隐屏","author":"陈普","text":"排云抵雨立虚空，端正方严万壑中。\n好去明堂充宁倚，不应留此伴仙翁。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7512,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"屡省乃成 其一","author":"陈普","text":"务本工夫在日新，悠悠莫自老青春。\n课功覈实惟时敏，德业何难辈古人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7513,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"屡省乃成 其二","author":"陈普","text":"诗书总学本无难，年少心身莫暂閒。\n尺寸之功当记取，将来百仞作高山。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7514,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"程氏馆灯下白菊花","author":"陈普","text":"灯前一阵玉胡蝶，火急教人网取看。\n乃是径中白甘菊，主人移入伴清寒。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7515,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"路中救小鱼","author":"陈普","text":"道逢涸辙一穷鱼，气息如丝沫尚濡。\n未得相携沧海去，蛙池共活谅中孚。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7516,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"愿月得雨兼旬秋晹人望已切再和前韵 其五","author":"陈普","text":"播谷栽桑复执麻，全凭雨露作人家。\n世间惟有心须霁，一片浮云不可遮。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7517,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"愿月得雨兼旬秋晹人望已切再和前韵 其四","author":"陈普","text":"须识光风霁月心，爱君忧国虑民深。\n江南一夜千仓廪，再拜双眸重照临。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7518,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"愿月得雨兼旬秋晹人望已切再和前韵 其六","author":"陈普","text":"得意如心即胜游，不妨对雨作遨头。\n穷櫩岂暇贤明月，举室寒衾喜有秋。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7519,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"愿月得雨兼旬秋晹人望已切再和前韵 其三","author":"陈普","text":"时雨光风总是吟，忧欢元不系晴阴。\n醍醐未用踰玄酒，中节何须论浅深。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7520,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"愿月得雨兼旬秋晹人望已切再和前韵 其一","author":"陈普","text":"踰浃秋晹已望云，芭蕉一夜慰愁人。\n阴阳各有时中处，不可相无似两轮。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7521,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"愿月得雨兼旬秋晹人望已切再和前韵 其二","author":"陈普","text":"雨我公田及我私，几多风月入肝脾。\n天心亦似尧心细，一日之中有隩夷。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7522,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"山中","author":"陈普","text":"便是人间一洞天，堕樵煮茗昼腾烟。\n深春笋蕨千钟禄，落日渔樵三岛仙。\n一脉甘泉生白石，数竿修竹对青毡。\n天关九府高无路，莫助椒芹献小鲜。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7523,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"长夏竹中 其二","author":"陈普","text":"暑威赫赫甑寰区，绕屋琅玕足自娱。\n四面尘埃浑不受，一年炎热竟成无。\n绝稀人迹天同处，阅尽诗书日未晡。\n为惜分阴故来此，时人疑是七贤徒。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7524,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"长夏竹中 其一","author":"陈普","text":"四围碧玉绕盘河，六月此为安乐窝。\n且喜身心各清净，但愁岁月为消磨。\n洞门开辟元无锁，暑气羞惭自倒戈。\n只要人心明内外，红尘取此本无多。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7525,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"东作","author":"陈普","text":"经纶一札急农功，骏发公私四海同。\n妇馌尚存豳国俗，耦耕不间楚乡风。\n乌犍纷乱烟云里，布谷焦劳风雨中。\n陇外辍耕相贺处，年来隳突绝西东。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7526,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"次答姚考成留别","author":"陈普","text":"别后相逢各问年，依然绿发对华颠。\n閒云独占半间住，伴客那无一榻眠。\n酒为愁多全欠力，诗因料少未成联。\n却怜壁上留题句，时有閒情到月边。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7527,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"自杭来有四圣观佛所言","author":"陈普","text":"浮杭江海备间关，金甲煌煌亦厚颜。\n一夕苍黄生病眼，百年丹碧照青湾。\n但闻兀朮声翻海，不谓罗延力拔山。\n琐琐废兴何足道，伤身空在暗香间。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7528,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"行藏","author":"陈普","text":"四时昼夜有成姿，用舍行藏亦易知。\n祭器无周应独抱，儒冠有越莫空资。\n乱由径窦人皆笑，不出门庭鬼亦疑。\n千古常经川上水，莫将闲气动诗脾。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7529,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"呈县尹 其二","author":"陈普","text":"富贵能无不俛眉，太玄久作覆瓿资。\n柴荆昼刻声何驶，芹草春风浪已披。\n似此深心宁为己，其如浅学谬蒙知。\n位无大小心惟一，已是当年吐哺时。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7530,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"呈县尹 其一","author":"陈普","text":"生贤造物意何仁，一本从来只为民。\n择取易中五阳卦，要令到处四时春。\n黄扉紫闼终行志，碧水丹山且爱人。\n满县栽花祇悦目，桑麻雨露是公真。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7531,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}}]